recruiter will respond with a clear plan.','textarea',0,'2026-10-13 16:04:45','2026-10-13 16:04:45'),(54,'home','final_cta_primary_label','Final CTA — primary button','Talk to Unite Systems','text',0,'2026-10-13 16:04:45','2026-10-13 16:04:45'),(55,'home','final_cta_primary_href','Final CTA — primary link','/contact','url',0,'2026-10-13 16:04:45','2026-10-13 16:04:45'),(56,'home','final_cta_secondary_label','Final CTA — secondary button','Browse Open Jobs','text',0,'2026-10-13 16:04:45','2026-10-13 16:04:45'),(57,'home','final_cta_secondary_href','Final CTA — secondary link','/jobs','url',0,'2026-10-13 16:04:45','2026-10-13 16:04:45'),(58,'about','hero_eyebrow','Hero — eyebrow','About Unite Systems','text',0,'2026-10-13 16:04:45','2026-10-13 16:04:45'),(59,'about','hero_title','Hero — title','Putting patient care at the heart of staffing.','text',0,'2026-10-13 16:04:45','2026-10-13 16:04:45'),(60,'about','hero_intro','Hero — intro','A fast-growing healthcare staffing partner, guided by leaders with more than 18 years of healthcare and staffing experience.','textarea',0,'2026-10-13 16:04:45','2026-10-13 16:04:45'),(61,'about','story_eyebrow','Story — eyebrow','Our story','text',0,'2026-10-13 16:04:45','2026-10-13 16:04:45'),(62,'about','story_title','Story — title','At Unite Systems, we tell it like it is.','text',0,'2026-10-13 16:04:45','2026-10-13 16:04:45'),(63,'about','story_body','Story — body','<p>Unite Systems is a dynamic, fast-growing healthcare staffing partner committed to excellence across a wide range of staffing solutions. We connect skilled healthcare professionals with hospitals, clinics and care facilities across the United States — providing full-time, part-time, contract, temp-to-hire and urgent placement services.</p><p>Guided by a leadership team with more than 18 years of experience in healthcare and staffing, we combine proven expertise with a fresh, agile approach to evolving workforce needs.</p><p>With a presence in the USA and India, we pair global reach with local expertise. Our recruiters work at the intersection of people, process and technology to deliver progressive, reliable and sustainable staffing for healthcare organizations and professionals alike.</p><p>We understand the challenges facing healthcare organizations today, and we are committed to being a partner that tells it like it is.</p>','richtext',0,'2026-10-13 16:04:45','2026-10-13 16:04:45'),(64,'about','mission','Mission','To transform healthcare delivery by strategically uniting top-tier professionals with forward-thinking healthcare institutions — ensuring exceptional patient outcomes, operational excellence and long-term organizational growth.','textarea',0,'2026-10-13 16:04:45','2026-10-13 16:04:45'),(65,'about','vision','Vision','To be the nation’s leading healthcare staffing partner — renowned for transforming lives, empowering careers and elevating healthcare standards through innovation, integrity and excellence.','textarea',0,'2026-10-13 16:04:45','2026-10-13 16:04:45'),(66,'about','values_eyebrow','Values — eyebrow','Core values','text',0,'2026-10-13 16:04:45','2026-10-13 16:04:45'),(67,'about','values_title','Values — title','The principles behind every placement.','text',0,'2026-10-13 16:04:45','2026-10-13 16:04:45'),(68,'about','why_eyebrow','Why — eyebrow','Why Unite Systems','text',0,'2026-10-13 16:04:45','2026-10-13 16:04:45'),(69,'about','why_title','Why — title','A staffing partner that tells it like it is.','text',0,'2026-10-13 16:04:45','2026-10-13 16:04:45'),(70,'about','why_intro','Why — intro','A dynamic, fast-growing healthcare staffing partner, guided by leaders with deep healthcare and staffing experience, and built on integrity, people, diversity, growth and respect.','textarea',0,'2026-10-13 16:04:45','2026-10-13 16:04:45'),(71,'about','locations_eyebrow','Locations — eyebrow','Where we work','text',0,'2026-10-13 16:04:45','2026-10-13 16:04:45'),(72,'about','locations_title','Locations — title','Local expertise, global reach.','text',0,'2026-10-13 16:04:45','2026-10-13 16:04:45'),(73,'services','hero_eyebrow','Hero — eyebrow','Industries & services','text',0,'2026-10-13 16:04:45','2026-10-13 16:04:45'),(74,'services','hero_title','Hero — title','Healthcare at our core. Expertise beyond it.','text',0,'2026-10-13 16:04:45','2026-10-13 16:04:45'),(75,'services','hero_intro','Hero — intro','Specialized staffing for healthcare, pharmaceuticals and information technology, with flexible models from urgent coverage to permanent placement.','textarea',0,'2026-10-13 16:04:45','2026-10-13 16:04:45'),(76,'services','specialties_eyebrow','Specialties — eyebrow','Specialties we place','text',0,'2026-10-13 16:04:45','2026-10-13 16:04:45'),(77,'services','specialties_title','Specialties — title','From the bedside to the back office.','text',0,'2026-10-13 16:04:45','2026-10-13 16:04:45'),(78,'services','specialties_intro','Specialties — intro','A wide range of clinical and non-clinical professionals — and many more roles across sectors to meet your needs.','textarea',0,'2026-10-13 16:04:45','2026-10-13 16:04:45'),(79,'jobs','hero_eyebrow','Hero — eyebrow','Careers','text',0,'2026-10-13 16:04:45','2026-10-13 16:04:45'),(80,'jobs','hero_title','Hero — title','Find your next healthcare role.','text',0,'2026-10-13 16:04:45','2026-10-13 16:04:45'),(81,'jobs','hero_intro','Hero — intro','Travel, contract, temp-to-hire and permanent opportunities with respected healthcare organizations across the United States.','textarea',0,'2026-10-13 16:04:45','2026-10-13 16:04:45'),(82,'jobs','empty_title','Empty state — title','No open roles match your search right now.','text',0,'2026-10-13 16:04:45','2026-10-13 16:04:45'),(83,'jobs','empty_text','Empty state — text','Create a profile and our recruiters will contact you when a matching role opens.','textarea',0,'2026-10-13 16:04:45','2026-10-13 16:04:45'),(84,'jobs','register_prompt_title','Register prompt — title','Applying to more than one role?','text',0,'2026-10-13 16:04:45','2026-10-13 16:04:45'),(85,'jobs','register_prompt_text','Register prompt — text','Create a free profile once — upload your resume and preferences — then apply to any job in one click.','textarea',0,'2026-10-13 16:04:45','2026-10-13 16:04:45'),(86,'register','title','Title','Create your candidate profile','text',0,'2026-10-13 16:04:45','2026-10-13 16:04:45'),(87,'register','intro','Intro','Register once to apply to multiple jobs, and let our recruiters match you with roles that fit your skills and preferred locations.','textarea',0,'2026-10-13 16:04:45','2026-10-13 16:04:45'),(88,'register','eeo_note','EEO note','Unite Systems is an Equal Opportunity Employer. Answering the disability question is voluntary and will not affect your application. It is kept separate from your profile and is not used in hiring decisions.','textarea',0,'2026-10-13 16:04:45','2026-10-13 16:04:45'),(89,'contact','hero_eyebrow','Hero — eyebrow','Let’s work together','text',0,'2026-10-13 16:04:45','2026-10-13 16:04:45'),(90,'contact','hero_title','Hero — title','Tell us what you need. We’ll take it from there.','text',0,'2026-10-13 16:04:45','2026-10-13 16:04:45'),(91,'contact','hero_intro','Hero — intro','Request healthcare talent for your facility, or share your details to explore your next role. A recruiter will respond with a clear plan.','textarea',0,'2026-10-13 16:04:45','2026-10-13 16:04:45'),(92,'contact','office_hours','Office hours','Monday–Friday, 9am–6pm ET','text',0,'2026-10-13 16:04:45','2026-10-13 16:04:45'),(93,'privacy','effective_date','Effective date','January 1, 2026','text',0,'2026-10-13 16:04:45','2026-10-13 16:04:45'),(94,'privacy','body','Policy body','<h3>Overview</h3><p>Unite Systems LLC (“Unite Systems”, “we”, “us”) respects your privacy. This policy explains what information we collect through our website and recruiting services, how we use and share it, and the choices you have.</p><p>It applies to visitors of our website, healthcare professionals and other candidates who apply through us, and representatives of the organizations we serve.</p><h3>Information we collect</h3><p>Information you give us, such as:</p><ul><li>Contact details — name, email address, phone number and location.</li><li>Candidate information — resume, work history, specialty, licenses and certifications, availability and job preferences.</li><li>Employer information — organization name, role requirements and staffing needs.</li><li>Messages you send us through forms, email, phone or text.</li></ul><h3>How we use your information</h3><ul><li>To respond to enquiries and provide our staffing and recruiting services.</li><li>To match candidates with suitable opportunities and present qualified candidates to client organizations.</li><li>To verify qualifications and complete onboarding requirements where applicable.</li><li>To communicate with you about your application, assignment or request, including by phone, email and text message.</li><li>To operate, secure and improve our website and services.</li><li>To comply with legal obligations and protect our rights.</li></ul><h3>How we share information</h3><p>We do not sell your personal information. We share it only as needed to provide our services:</p><ul><li>With healthcare facilities and client organizations when presenting you for an opportunity you are interested in.</li><li>With service providers who support our operations (for example hosting, email and applicant-tracking tools), under confidentiality obligations.</li><li>When required by law, legal process or to protect the rights, property or safety of Unite Systems, our clients or others.</li></ul><h3>Text messaging (SMS)</h3><p>By providing a phone number and submitting a form, you consent to be contacted by SMS text message about your request or application. Message and data rates may apply. Message frequency may vary.</p><p>You can opt out at any time by replying STOP, and get help by replying HELP. Mobile information will not be shared with third parties or affiliates for marketing or promotional purposes, and SMS opt-in data and consent will not be shared with any third parties.</p><h3>Cookies and analytics</h3><p>We may use cookies and analytics tools to understand how visitors use our website and to improve it. You can control cookies through your browser settings; some features may not work without them.</p><h3>Data retention and security</h3><p>We keep personal information for as long as needed for the purposes described in this policy, including to consider you for future opportunities, unless you ask us to delete it or the law requires otherwise.</p><p>We use reasonable administrative, technical and physical safeguards to protect your information. No method of transmission or storage is completely secure.</p><h3>Your choices and rights</h3><p>You may ask us to access, correct or delete your personal information, or to stop contacting you. Depending on where you live, you may have additional rights under state law. To make a request, contact us using the details below.</p><h3>Children’s privacy</h3><p>Our website and services are intended for adults. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 16.</p><h3>Links to other websites</h3><p>Our website may link to websites we do not operate. Their privacy practices are governed by their own policies.</p><h3>Changes to this policy</h3><p>We may update this policy from time to time. We will post the updated version on this page with a new effective date.</p>','richtext',0,'2026-10-13 16:04:45','2026-10-13 16:04:45'),(95,'home','humantech_eyebrow','Human expertise — eyebrow','Our approach','text',0,'2026-10-14 06:02:28','2026-10-14 06:02:28'),(96,'home','humantech_title','Human expertise — title','Human expertise. Smarter workforce technology.','text',0,'2026-10-14 06:02:28','2026-10-14 06:02:28'),(97,'home','humantech_intro','Human expertise — intro','Recruiters who understand healthcare, supported by our own sourcing platform, connecting the right professionals with the organizations that need them.','textarea',0,'2026-10-14 06:02:28','2026-10-14 06:02:28'),(98,'home','humantech_left_label','Human expertise — left column label','Healthcare professionals','text',0,'2026-10-14 06:02:28','2026-10-14 06:02:28'),(99,'home','humantech_right_label','Human expertise — right column label','Healthcare organizations','text',0,'2026-10-14 06:02:28','2026-10-14 06:02:28'),(100,'home','humantech_hub_label','Human expertise — hub eyebrow','Unite Systems','text',0,'2026-10-14 06:02:28','2026-10-14 06:02:28'),(101,'home','humantech_hub_title','Human expertise — hub title','People + platform','text',0,'2026-10-14 06:02:28','2026-10-14 06:02:28');
