plus our in-house sourcing platform.',NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-10-13 16:04:45','2026-10-13 16:04:45'),(14,'home_challenges','Clock','Time-to-fill pressure',NULL,'Every open shift puts pressure on teams and patient care.','Urgent placement support and local recruiters who already know the talent in your market.',NULL,NULL,0,1,1,'2026-10-13 16:04:45','2026-10-13 16:04:45'),(15,'home_challenges','ShieldCheck','Compliance complexity',NULL,'Licenses, certifications and documentation must be right before day one.','Candidates screened and matched to your facility’s requirements before they’re presented.',NULL,NULL,0,1,2,'2026-10-13 16:04:45','2026-10-13 16:04:45'),(16,'home_challenges','TrendingUp','Workforce scalability',NULL,'Census, seasons and projects change faster than hiring cycles.','Flexible models, from a few weeks of coverage to permanent hires and interim leadership.',NULL,NULL,0,1,3,'2026-10-13 16:04:45','2026-10-13 16:04:45'),(17,'home_solutions','Stethoscope','Healthcare Staffing',NULL,'The widest range of nurse and clinical staffing, with specialties and assignment lengths customized to your facility.',NULL,'[\"Nurse staffing\", \"Travel nurse staffing\", \"Allied health staffing\", \"Physician staffing\"]',NULL,1,1,0,'2026-10-13 16:04:45','2026-10-13 16:04:45'),(18,'home_solutions','Layers','Flexible Workforce Solutions',NULL,'Coverage that flexes with demand — full-time, part-time, contract, temp-to-hire and urgent placements.',NULL,'[\"Contract\", \"Temp-to-hire\", \"Urgent placement\"]',NULL,0,1,1,'2026-10-13 16:04:45','2026-10-13 16:04:45'),(19,'home_solutions','UserCheck','Talent Acquisition',NULL,'Permanent placement for nurses, allied professionals and physicians who fit your culture.',NULL,'[\"Permanent placement\", \"Physician placement\"]',NULL,0,1,2,'2026-10-13 16:04:45','2026-10-13 16:04:45'),(20,'home_solutions','BadgeCheck','Interim Nurse Leadership',NULL,'Experienced nurse leaders to steady a unit through transitions and vacancies.',NULL,'[\"Interim leadership\", \"Leadership transitions\"]',NULL,0,1,3,'2026-10-13 16:04:45','2026-10-13 16:04:45'),(21,'home_solutions','FlaskConical','Pharma & IT Staffing',NULL,'Specialist recruiters for pharmaceutical, life sciences and information technology teams.',NULL,'[\"R&D and regulatory\", \"Quality assurance\", \"Project management\"]',NULL,0,1,4,'2026-10-13 16:04:45','2026-10-13 16:04:45'),(22,'home_process','Search','Understand','01','We learn your roles, shift patterns, assignment lengths, culture and compliance requirements.',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-10-13 16:04:45','2026-10-13 16:04:45'),(23,'home_process','Users','Match','02','We source from our pre-screened network and in-house platform, matching for skills and fit.',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,1,'2026-10-13 16:04:45','2026-10-13 16:04:45'),(24,'home_process','Rocket','Mobilize','03','We coordinate onboarding so your professional is ready to start on time.',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,2,'2026-10-13 16:04:45','2026-10-13 16:04:45'),(25,'home_process','LifeBuoy','Support','04','We stay close through every assignment and step in promptly if challenges arise.',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,3,'2026-10-13 16:04:45','2026-10-13 16:04:45'),(26,'professional_benefits','Briefcase','Job opportunities',NULL,'Travel, contract, temp-to-hire and permanent roles with respected healthcare organizations.',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-10-13 16:04:45','2026-10-13 16:04:45'),(27,'professional_benefits','GraduationCap','Career support',NULL,'An experienced healthcare recruiter who understands your specialty.',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,1,'2026-10-13 16:04:45','2026-10-13 16:04:45'),(28,'professional_benefits','Compass','Placement assistance',NULL,'Help finding assignments that fit your skills, location and goals.',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,2,'2026-10-13 16:04:46','2026-10-13 16:04:46'),(29,'professional_benefits','FileCheck2','Credentialing support',NULL,'Guidance getting your documentation in order before day one.',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,3,'2026-10-13 16:04:46','2026-10-13 